This repo is the OS-build / template workspace — NOT a conforming business instance.

scripts/project-contract.js refuses to scaffold instance data while this sentinel exists,
so the template never gets polluted with a single business's wiki/decisions/etc.

To stand up a real business (Step 9 — onboarding):
  1. Clone/copy this repo to a new location dedicated to that one business.
  2. Delete this file (.os-build-workspace) in that clone — the deliberate
     "this clone is now a business instance" gesture.
  3. node scripts/project-contract.js <business-slug>
  4. Fill .secrets/.env, then git init && commit.
     (No skill-install step — the skills ARE .claude/skills/ and travel with the clone.)
